<title>TUNISIA: Germany gives Tunisia 27 million mark grant.</title>
<headline>Germany gives Tunisia 27 million mark grant.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-10-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany has donated 27 million marks ($17.8 million) to Tunisia for sewerage projects in four towns, officials said on Saturday.</p>
<p>They said the projects would be in the towns of Mateur, Ras Jebel, El Alia and Raf-Raf in northern Tunisia.</p>
<p>The donation covers 70 percent of the total costs of these four projects.</p>
</text>
